{"questions":[{"question_id":"lvc58eru","content":"<p>A conductivity cell with two electrodes (dark side) are half filled with infinitely dilute aqueous solution of a weak electrolyte. If volume is doubled by adding more water at constant temperature, the molar conductivity of the cell will -</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 6th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Electrochemistry Question 44 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","chapter":"electrochemistry","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-6th-april-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 6th April Morning Shift","permalink":"pa-conductivity-cell-with-two-electrodes-dark-side-are-h-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-0tf49zpmtbeqyvzl","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>A conductivity cell with two electrodes (dark side) are half filled with infinitely dilute aqueous solution of a weak electrolyte. If volume is doubled by adding more water at constant temperature, the molar conductivity of the cell will -</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 6th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Electrochemistry Question 44 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lvc2aewd/87a870c2-f928-408c-8096-604097f61ab3/ae5b19d0-0142-11ef-9994-d5a6f8729fd1/file-1lvc2aewe.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"depend upon type of electrolyte"},{"identifier":"B","content":"increase sharply"},{"identifier":"C","content":"decrease sharply"},{"identifier":"D","content":"remain same or can not be measured accurately"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>The molar conductivity, denoted as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.101ex\" height=\"1.71ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -598 1370.8 755.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, is calculated using the formula:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.803ex\" height=\"2.765ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 5658.9 1222\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1648.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2704.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1556,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1153,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"2714.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>When the volume of the solution is doubled by adding more water at a constant temperature, the conductivity, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 778 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, will be reduced to half, while the molarity, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.075ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 917 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, will also be halved.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the molar conductivity <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.839ex\" height=\"1.91ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 1255 844\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> will either remain the same or cannot be measured with sharp accuracy.</p>\n\n<p>For an infinitely dilute solution, the molar conductivity <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.029ex\" height=\"1.692ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -598 1339 748\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is approximately equal to the molar conductivity at infinite dilution <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.559ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.029ex\" height=\"2.446ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 1339 1080.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(700,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(700,-247) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, which is a constant.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>दो इलेक्ट्रोडों (गाढ़ा फलक) सहित एक चालकता सेल विद्युत अपघट्य के अनन्त तनुकृत जलीय विलयन से आधा भरा हुआ है। स्थिर ताप पर यदि इसके आयतन को और अधिक जल मिलाकर दोगुना कर दिया जाए तो सेल की मोलर चालकता:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1lxo51hmd/b049b2cb-558b-4cec-aa01-a5fee5a7f9b0/481d5a50-2f7f-11ef-a6b6-ff8ce42a6456/file-jaoe38c1lxo51hme.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1lxo51hmd/b049b2cb-558b-4cec-aa01-a5fee5a7f9b0/481d5a50-2f7f-11ef-a6b6-ff8ce42a6456/file-jaoe38c1lxo51hme.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 6th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Electrochemistry Question 44 Hindi\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1lxo51hmd/b049b2cb-558b-4cec-aa01-a5fee5a7f9b0/481d5a50-2f7f-11ef-a6b6-ff8ce42a6456/file-jaoe38c1lxo51hme.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1lxo51hmd/b049b2cb-558b-4cec-aa01-a5fee5a7f9b0/481d5a50-2f7f-11ef-a6b6-ff8ce42a6456/file-jaoe38c1lxo51hme.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1lxo51hmd/b049b2cb-558b-4cec-aa01-a5fee5a7f9b0/481d5a50-2f7f-11ef-a6b6-ff8ce42a6456/file-jaoe38c1lxo51hme.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1lxo51hmd/b049b2cb-558b-4cec-aa01-a5fee5a7f9b0/481d5a50-2f7f-11ef-a6b6-ff8ce42a6456/file-jaoe38c1lxo51hme.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1lxo51hmd/b049b2cb-558b-4cec-aa01-a5fee5a7f9b0/481d5a50-2f7f-11ef-a6b6-ff8ce42a6456/file-jaoe38c1lxo51hme.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1lxo51hmd/b049b2cb-558b-4cec-aa01-a5fee5a7f9b0/481d5a50-2f7f-11ef-a6b6-ff8ce42a6456/file-jaoe38c1lxo51hme.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"विद्युत अपघट्य पर निर्भर करेगी\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"तेज़ी से बढ़ेगी\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"तेज़ी से घटेगी"},{"identifier":"D","content":"समान रहेगी या यथॉथतः मापी नहीं जा सकती।\n"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>मोलर चालकता, जिसे <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.101ex\" height=\"1.71ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -598 1370.8 755.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> से निरूपित किया जाता है, निम्नलिखित सूत्र का उपयोग करके परिकलित की जाती है:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.803ex\" height=\"2.765ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 5658.9 1222\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1648.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2704.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1556,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1153,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"2714.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>जब स्थिर तापमान पर अधिक जल मिलाकर विलयन का आयतन दोगुना किया जाता है, तो चालकता, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 778 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, आधी हो जाएगी, जबकि मोलरता, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.075ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 917 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, भी आधी हो जाएगी।</p>\n\n<p>इसलिए, मोलर चालकता <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.839ex\" height=\"1.91ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 1255 844\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> या तो समान रहेगी या तीक्ष्ण शुद्धता के साथ मापी नहीं जा सकती।</p>\n\n<p>अनंत तनु विलयन के लिए, मोलर चालकता <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.029ex\" height=\"1.692ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -598 1339 748\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> लगभग अनंत तनुता पर मोलर चालकता <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.559ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.029ex\" height=\"2.446ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 1339 1080.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(700,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(700,-247) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> के बराबर होती है, जो एक स्थिरांक है।</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"conductance-and-electrolysis","type":"mcq","year":2024,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-6th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"depend upon type of electrolyte"},{"identifier":"B","content":"increase sharply"},{"identifier":"C","content":"decrease sharply"},{"identifier":"D","content":"remain same or can not be measured accurately"}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"<p>The molar conductivity, denoted as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.101ex\" height=\"1.71ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -598 1370.8 755.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, is calculated using the formula:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.803ex\" height=\"2.765ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877 5658.9 1222\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1648.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2704.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1556,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1153,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"2714.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>When the volume of the solution is doubled by adding more water at a constant temperature, the conductivity, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 778 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, will be reduced to half, while the molarity, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.075ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 917 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, will also be halved.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the molar conductivity <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.839ex\" height=\"1.91ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 1255 844\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(616,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> will either remain the same or cannot be measured with sharp accuracy.</p>\n\n<p>For an infinitely dilute solution, the molar conductivity <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.029ex\" height=\"1.692ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -598 1339 748\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(700,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is approximately equal to the molar conductivity at infinite dilution <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.559ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.029ex\" height=\"2.446ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 1339 1080.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2227\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2227\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(700,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(700,-247) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, which is a constant.</p>"}]}